--
brace_init_to_init_list_is_viable (cpp_typecheck_fargs.cpp) now treats a
nested braced-init-list element as list-initialization of the element type.
Found by dog-fooding src/goto-programs (json_objectt({{...}, {...}})).
The map keys are one character long: `--unwind 4' cut the strlen of longer
ones, and the map assertions were not reached.
